^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR
^.*FAILURE$
--
Regression for LinkedList model: add, get, size, getFirst,
getLast, isEmpty, addFirst, removeFirst.

addFirst and removeFirst were previously broken because the
model used System.arraycopy with overlapping source and
destination ranges. JBMC's array model treats arraycopy as
opaque, so no elements were transferred. The fix
(REVIEW-PRE-PUSH medium item 4) replaced the arraycopy calls
with element-wise shift loops; both methods now work.
